---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Resources
description: References for passkeys, WebAuthn, phishing-resistant MFA, and getting started.
permalink: /resources/
---

<section class="site-shell content-section">
  <p class="eyebrow">Go deeper</p>
  <h1>Resources</h1>
  <p class="lede">If the talk gave you the mental model, these links are the next step: a short path from plain-language explainers to implementation guidance and standards.</p>

  {% for group in talk.sources | sourceGroups %}
    <section class="resource-group" aria-labelledby="source-group-{{ loop.index }}">
      <h2 id="source-group-{{ loop.index }}">{{ group.type }}</h2>
      <div class="source-grid">
        {% for source in group.items %}
          <article class="source-card">
            <p class="type">{{ source.key }}</p>
            <h3><a href="{{ source.url }}">{{ source.title }}</a></h3>
            <p>{{ source.why }}</p>
          </article>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
